#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:105
msgid "Inpainting Photograph Tool"
msgstr "Ferramenta de Pintura Interior de Fotografias"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:106
msgid "You need to select a region to inpaint to use this tool"
msgstr "Necesita escoller unha rexión a pintar para usar esta ferramenta"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:123 imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:142
#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:169
msgid "Photograph Inpainting"
msgstr "Pintura Interior de Fotografias"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:127
msgid "&Save As..."
msgstr "&Guardar Como..."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:128
msgid "&Load..."
msgstr "&Carregar..."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:132
msgid "<p>Reset all filter parameters to their default values."
msgstr ""
"<p>Reiniciar todos os parámetros do filtro aos seus valores predefinidos."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:133
msgid "<p>Load all filter parameters from settings text file."
msgstr ""
"<p>Carregar todos os parámetros do filtro a partir do ficheiro de "
"configuración."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:134
msgid "<p>Save all filter parameters to settings text file."
msgstr ""
"<p>Guardar todos os parámetros do filtro nun ficheiro de configuración."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:144
msgid "A digiKam image plugin to inpaint a photograph."
msgstr "Un plugin de digiKam para pintar interiormente unha fotografia."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:150
msgid "Author and maintainer"
msgstr "Autoria e mantemento"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:153
msgid "CImg library"
msgstr "Biblioteca CImg"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:156
msgid "Feedback and plugin polishing"
msgstr "Reaccións e polemento do plugin"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:162
msgid "Plugin Handbook"
msgstr "Manual do plugin"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:179
msgid "Preset"
msgstr "Predefinición"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:187
msgid "Visit CImg library website"
msgstr "Páxina Web da biblioteca CImg"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:189
msgid "Filtering type:"
msgstr "Tipo de filtraxe:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:192
msgid "None"
msgstr "Nengun"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:193
msgid "Remove Small Artefact"
msgstr "Eliminar os Artefactos Pequenos"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:194
msgid "Remove Medium Artefact"
msgstr "Eliminar os Artefactos Meios"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:195
msgid "Remove Large Artefact"
msgstr "Eliminar os Artefactos Grandes"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:196
msgid ""
"<p>Select here the filter preset to use for photograph restoration:"
"<p><b>None</b>: Most common values. Puts settings to default."
"<p><b>Remove Small Artefact</b>: inpaint small image artefact like image "
"glitch."
"<p><b>Remove Medium Artefact</b>: inpaint medium image artefact."
"<p><b>Remove Large Artefact</b>: inpaint image artefact like unwanted object."
"<p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Escolla aqui os axustes do filtro a usar na restauración das fotografias:"
"<p><b>Nengun</b>: Os valores mais comuns. Coloca a configuración no estado "
"predefinido."
"<p><b>Eliminar os Artefactos Pequenos</b>: pinta os pequenos artefactos da "
"imaxe, como os pequenos defeitos de imaxe."
"<p><b>Eliminar os Artefactos Meios</b>: pinta os artefactos meios de imaxe."
"<p><b>Eliminar os Artefactos Grandes</b>: pinta os artefactos grandes, como os "
"obxectos indesexados."
"<p>"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:208
msgid "<p>This is the current percentage of the task completed."
msgstr "<p>Esta é a porcentaxe da tarefa actualmente completa."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:216
msgid "Smoothing"
msgstr "Suavización"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:218
msgid "Detail preservation:"
msgstr "Preservación dos detalles:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:223
msgid ""
"<p>Preservation of details to set the sharpening level of the small features in "
"the target image. Higher values leave details sharp."
msgstr ""
"<p>A preservación dos detalles serve para definir o nível de afiamento dos "
"pequenos detalles na imaxe de destino. Os valores mais altos deixan os detalles "
"ben definidos."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:229
msgid "Anisotropy:"
msgstr "Anisotropia:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:234
msgid ""
"<p>Anisotropic (directional) modifier of the details. Keep it small for "
"Gaussian noise."
msgstr ""
"<p>Modificador anisotrópico (direccional) dos detalles. Deixe-o baixo para "
"obter un ruído Gausiano."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:238
msgid "Smoothing:"
msgstr "Suavización:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:243
msgid ""
"<p>Total smoothing power: if Detail Factor sets the relative smoothing and "
"Gradient Factor the direction, Time Step sets the overall effect."
msgstr ""
"<p>Poténcia de suavización total: se o Factor de Detalle define a suavización "
"relativa e o Factor Gradiente a dirección, o Paso Temporal define o efeito "
"global."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:248
msgid "Regularity:"
msgstr "Regularidade:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:253
msgid ""
"<p>This value controls the smoothing regularity of the target image. Do not use "
"an high value here, else the target image will be completely blurred."
msgstr ""
"<p>Este valor controla a regularidade de suavización da imaxe final. Non use un "
"valor alto aqui, en caso contrário a imaxe final quedará completamente borrada."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:259
msgid "Iterations:"
msgstr "Iteracións:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:264
msgid "<p>Sets the number of times the filter is applied on the target image."
msgstr "<p>Define o número de veces que o filtro é aplicado na imaxe final."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:272
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "Configuración Avanzada"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:274
msgid "Angular step:"
msgstr "Paso angular:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:279
msgid ""
"<p>Set here the angular integration step in degrees in analogy to anisotropy."
msgstr ""
"<p>Defina aqui o paso de integración angular en graus, en analoxia coa "
"anisotropia."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:283
msgid "Integral step:"
msgstr "Paso integral:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:288
msgid "<p>Set here the spatial integral step. Stay below 1."
msgstr "<p>Defina aqui o paso integral espacial. Defina-o como menor que 1."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:292
msgid "Gaussian:"
msgstr "Gausiano:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:297
msgid "<p>Set here the precision of the Gaussian function."
msgstr "<p>Defina aqui a precisión da función gausiana."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:301
msgid "Use linear interpolation"
msgstr "Usar a interpolación linear"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:302
msgid "<p>Enable this option to quench the last bit of quality (slow)."
msgstr ""
"<p>Active esta opción para aproveitar o último ponto de calidade (lento)."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:305
msgid "Normalize photograph"
msgstr "Normalizar a fotografia"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:306
msgid "<p>Enable this option to process an output image normalization."
msgstr "<p>Active esta opción para procesar unha normalización na imaxe final."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:550
msgid "InPainting"
msgstr "Pintura Interior"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:575
msgid "Photograph Inpainting Settings File to Load"
msgstr "Carregando o Arquivo de Configuración da Pintura Interior"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:587
msgid "\"%1\" is not a Photograph Inpainting settings text file."
msgstr ""
"\"%1\" non é un ficheiro de configuración de pintura interior de fotografias."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:608
msgid "Cannot load settings from the Photograph Inpainting text file."
msgstr ""
"Non foi posíbel carregar a configuración do ficheiro de pintura interior de "
"fotografias."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:617
msgid "Photograph Inpainting Settings File to Save"
msgstr "Guardando Arquivo de Configuración da Pintura Interior"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:639
msgid "Cannot save settings to the Photograph Inpainting text file."
msgstr ""
"Non foi posíbel guardar a configuración no ficheiro de texto de pintura "
"interior de fotografias."

#: imageplugin_inpainting.cpp:41
msgid "Inpainting..."
msgstr "Pintura Interior..."

#: imageplugin_inpainting.cpp:45
msgid ""
"This filter can be used to inpaint a part in a photo. Select a region to "
"inpaint to use this option."
msgstr ""
"Este filtro pode ser usado para pintar interiormente unha parte dunha "
"fotografia. Escolla a rexión a pintar para usar esta opción."

